{{Term/Store|Raw Gourmet Meat|Raw Gourmet Meats|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Quests|
{{BotW Quest
 |name= A Rare Find
 |type= Side Quest
 |giver= [[Trott]]
 |location= [[Outskirt Stable]]
}}
}}
Raw Gourmet Meats are dropped by [[Water Buffalo]], [[Snowcoat Fox]]es, [[Maraudo Wolf|Maraudo Wolves]], [[Wasteland Coyote]]s, [[Cold-Footed Wolf|Cold-Footed Wolves]], [[Tabantha Moose]], [[Great-Horned Rhinoceros]], [[Honeyvore Bear]]s, and [[Grizzlemaw Bear]]s when they are killed. When eaten, Raw Gourmet Meat heals three [[Heart]]s to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Raw Gourmet Meat can also be roasted by a [[Fire]] to make [[Seared Gourmet Steak]] or frozen to make [[Icy Gourmet Meat]].

When [[Link]] speaks to [[Trott]] at [[Outskirt Stable]], he will express a desire for Raw Gourmet Meat.<ref name="BotW Trott"/> This will activate the [[Side Quest]] "[[A Rare Find]]". If Link gives him some, he will be paid 100 [[Rupee]]s.<ref name="BotW Trott 2"/> Afterwards, Link can give Trott Raw Gourmet Meat at any time for 100 Rupees.

