==={{TotK|-}}===
Raw Gourmet Meats return in {{TotK}}. They are dropped by the same [[Animal]]s when killed, with the exception of [[Great-Horned Rhinoceros]]es. When eaten, Raw Gourmet Meats restore three [[Heart]]s to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]]. Raw Gourmet Meat can also be burned or frozen to make [[Seared Gourmet Steak]], and [[Icy Gourmet Meat]], respectively.

Raw Gourmet Meat can also be [[Fuse]]d to [[Equipment]] and [[Mineru's Construct]], increasing the [[Weapon]] or [[Arrow]]'s attack power by one. Raw Gourmet Meat has a Fuse durability of five when Fused to Mineru's Construct. When Fused, Raw Gourmet Meats can still be burned or frozen, and they do not conduct [[Electricity]]. Additionally, when Fused to a Weapon or [[Shield]], the Raw Gourmet Meat removes its sharpness or its ability to be used for [[Shield Surfing]], respectively.

